## Design System Tokens (index.css)

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| `--color-primary` | `#0077B6` (medical blue) |
| `--color-secondary` | `#00B4D8` |
| `--color-accent` | `#06D6A0` (green for success) |
| `--color-danger` | `#EF476F` |
| Font | Inter (Google Fonts) |
| Border radius | 8 / 16 / 24px scale |

